### List events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one event
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "HTTP Test Event",
  "eventDescription": "Created from IntelliJ HTTP Client",
  "startsOn": "2026-11-15T18:00:00",
  "creatorId": 0,
  "locationId": {{locationId}}
}

### Replace an event
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventName": "Updated HTTP Event",
  "eventDescription": "Replaced from IntelliJ HTTP Client",
  "startsOn": "2026-12-05T09:00:00",
  "creatorId": 0,
  "locationId": {{locationId}}
}

### Partially update an event
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventDescription": "Patched from IntelliJ HTTP Client"
}

### Get event attendee count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/{{eventId}}/totalAttendees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a missing event: should return 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
